00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.293
I could have one drink,
and that was gonna be it.

00:07:54.293 --> 00:07:56.122
Go from eight to one.

00:07:56.122 --> 00:07:58.916
(contemplative music)

00:07:58.916 --> 00:07:59.832
- Weekend was tough.

00:07:59.832 --> 00:08:03.410
I was at brunch, and everyone
