00:09:09.736 --> 00:09:12.009
(contemplative music)

00:09:12.009 --> 00:09:14.171
It definitely feels miles
away from where I was

00:09:14.171 --> 00:09:15.923
last week, for sure.

00:09:15.923 --> 00:09:17.968
- I did notice a really big difference.

00:09:17.968 --> 00:09:21.158
I noticed the anxiety was gone.

00:09:21.158 --> 00:09:22.628
- I don't think cutting out caffeine

00:09:22.628 --> 00:09:24.947
