00:09:24.947 --> 00:09:27.290
- I've also been very productive at work.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.403
- Working out helped it,

00:09:29.403 --> 00:09:31.293
that definitely like soothed the anxiety.

00:09:31.293 --> 00:09:35.220
- I do remember the day that
we did the first interview

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.001
I was way more, I was just thinking about

00:09:38.001 --> 00:09:39.204
how anxious I was.

00:09:39.204 --> 00:09:42.430
Right now, there's no part of
my brain that I'm thinking,

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.017
man, my anxiety is out of control today.

00:09:45.017 --> 00:09:47.185
- One thing that many
people don't realize,

00:09:47.185 --> 00:09:49.752
is that when you become
tolerant to a drug,

00:09:49.752 --> 00:09:52.144
you don't become tolerant
to all the effects

00:09:52.144 --> 00:09:54.523
in the same way at the same time.

00:09:54.523 --> 00:09:57.806
So what often happens,
is people become tolerant

00:09:57.806 --> 00:10:00.531
to the stimulating effects
of the drug, let's say,

00:10:00.531 --> 00:10:03.507
or the euphoric effects of the drug,

00:10:03.507 --> 00:10:05.407
but they don't become
tolerant to some of the

00:10:05.407 --> 00:10:06.892
side effects of a drug.

00:10:06.892 --> 00:10:09.811
- And so, going forward, I'm gonna drink

00:10:09.811 --> 00:10:11.560
one cup of coffee every day.

